OL,5,G0855 Find It, Fix It, Flog It
OL,6,     FIn Woking, Simon O'Brien and Max
OL,7,     FMcMurdo find a sidecar; could it
OL,8,     Fbe transformed into a boat? And
OL,9,     FSimon thinks that a water cylinder
OL,10,     Fcould become a trendy lamp.
OL,11,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FThe competition kicks off at the
OL,13,     FBrighton Surf Hotel, where Jeremy
OL,14,     FMann and his Russian wife Elena
OL,15,     Fhope that their hands-off hosting
OL,16,     Fstyle will win the day, despite
OL,17,     Fthe lack of breakfast.
